// GENERATED by tools/w11_stream_latgen.py -- do not edit; edit the generator's sources.
// W11 streaming domain (1.2 GHz at SS): the latency-parameterised (FPL binary32 add, FML product, QL block dot)
// attention tile (product, chunk chain, head datapath, tile, FP32 add wrapper).  Each module below is the text of rtl/hdc/v41x/ot_hdc_v41x_attn_tile.sv at cd1b1061 with the streaming module names
